{"sha": "3f96b3eda60e736f352b7e7861dbae1153b60c61d5fbbca2e518617b8a757ae7", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\tdplotsetmaincoords{60}{100}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[tdplot_main_coords, font=\\small]", "  \\pic {omcubeo={3}};", "    \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (0,0,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={violet!70}{3.8mm}] at (0,1.5,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (0,3,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={violet!70}{3.8mm}] at (0,0,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (0,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={violet!70}{3.8mm}] at (0,3,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={violet!70}{3.8mm}] at (1.5,0,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (0,0,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (1.5,1.5,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={violet!70}{3.8mm}] at (0,1.5,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={violet!70}{3.8mm}] at (1.5,3,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (0,3,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (1.5,0,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={violet!70}{3.8mm}] at (1.5,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (1.5,3,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (3,0,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={violet!70}{3.8mm}] at (1.5,0,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={violet!70}{3.8mm}] at (3,1.5,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (1.5,1.5,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (3,3,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={violet!70}{3.8mm}] at (1.5,3,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={violet!70}{3.8mm}] at (3,0,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (3,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={violet!70}{3.8mm}] at (3,3,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (3,0,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={violet!70}{3.8mm}] at (3,1.5,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (3,3,3) {};", "  \\node at (1.5,1.5,-1.75) {\\ce{NaCl}（氯化钠型）};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\hspace{1cm}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[tdplot_main_coords, font=\\small]", "  \\pic {omcubeo={3}};", "    \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (0,0,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (0,3,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (0,0,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (0,3,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={blue!60}{7mm}] at (1.5,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (3,0,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (3,3,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (3,0,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!55!black}{6.5mm}] at (3,3,3) {};", "  \\node at (1.5,1.5,-1.75) {\\ce{CsCl}（氯化铯型）};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左：氯化钠型晶胞，\\ce{Cl-}（绿色）位于面心立方晶格上，", "\\ce{Na+}（紫色）占据每个八面体间隙。右：氯化铯型晶胞，", "\\ce{Cl-}位于顶点，\\ce{Cs+}（蓝色）位于晶胞中心。离子画得", "比相切时小。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[氯化钠型与氯化铯型]\\label{prop:b1:crystals-ionic-covalent:nacl-cscl}", "在氯化钠型中，每个晶胞含 $Z = 4$ 个化学式单位，离子", "沿棱相切，$a = 2(r_+ + r_-)$，且结构要求 $\\sqrt2 - 1", "\\le x$。在氯化铯型中，$Z = 1$，离子沿", "体对角线相切，$a\\sqrt3 = 2(r_+ + r_-)$，且结构要求", "$x \\ge \\sqrt3 - 1$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "氯化钠型：面心立方晶格上的阴离子数为 $4$，八面体间隙中的阳离子数为", "$1 + 12 \\times \\frac14 = 4$。沿棱方向，阴离子、", "阳离子与阴离子依次相接。阴离子不重叠，须", "面对角线（含三个阴离子，其中至多两个相接）满足", "$a\\sqrt2 \\ge 4r_-$，即 $2(r_+ + r_-)\\sqrt2 \\ge", "4r_-$，亦即 $x \\ge \\sqrt2 - 1$。氯化铯型：$8 \\times \\frac18 = 1$", "个阴离子和 1 个阳离子；沿体对角线依次为阴离子、阳离子、阴离子相接；", "若沿棱方向阴离子不重叠，须 $a \\ge 2r_-$，即", "$2(r_+ + r_-)/\\sqrt3 \\ge 2r_-$，亦即 $x \\ge \\sqrt3 - 1$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[氯化钠与氯化铯]\\label{ex:b1:crystals-ionic-covalent:nacl}", "氯化钠的 $a = \\qty{564.1}{pm}$：$r_+ + r_- = a/2 =", "\\qty{282.0}{pm}$，与 Shannon 半径给出的 $102 + 181 = \\qty{283}{pm}$ 相比；", "$x = 102/181 = 0.56$，位于八面体范围内。其密度为", "$\\rho = 4 \\times 58.44/(6.022 \\times 10^{23} \\times (5.641 \\times", "10^{-8})^3) = \\qty{2.16}{g/cm^3}$，实测为 \\qty{2.17}{g/cm^3}。", "氯化铯的 $a = \\qty{412.3}{pm}$：$r_+ + r_- = a\\sqrt3/2 =", "\\qty{357.1}{pm}$，且 $x = 174/181 = 0.96$，位于立方范围内。", "% ledger: lat:NaCl, rion:Na+VI, rion:Cl-VI, rho:NaCl, lat:CsCl,", "% rion:Cs+VIII", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{minipage}[b]{0.31\\linewidth}\\centering", "\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth]{images/book2/halite.jpg}", "", "{\\small 石盐（氯化钠型）晶体。照片：James St. John，CC BY 2.0。}", "\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}[b]{0.31\\linewidth}\\centering", "\\includegraphics[width=0.85\\linewidth]{images/book2/fluorite.jpg}", "", "{\\small 萤石，\\ce{CaF2}。照片：James St. John，CC BY 2.0。}", "\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}[b]{0.31\\linewidth}\\centering", "\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth]{images/book2/diamond.jpg}", "", "{\\small 一颗粗糙的金刚石八面体。照片：James St. John，CC BY 2.0。}", "\\end{minipage}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[闪锌矿型与萤石型]\\label{prop:b1:crystals-ionic-covalent:zns-caf2}", "在闪锌矿型中，$Z = 4$，每个离子被四个异种离子", "包围，这些离子位于四面体的顶点，离子沿体对角线的", "四分之一相切：$a\\sqrt3/4 = r_+ + r_-$。在萤石型中，", "$Z = 4$ 个 \\ce{CaF2} 单位，每个阳离子有 8 个阴离子近邻（组成立方体），", "每个阴离子有 4 个阳离子近邻（组成四面体），且同样有 $a\\sqrt3/4 =", "r_+ + r_-$。", "\\end{proposition}", ""]}